{"id":"stoya","lemma":"стоя","pos":"adv","rank":3186,"glosses":["standing, upright (in or into an upright position)"],"examples":[{"text":"Я сплю стоя.","en":"I sleep standing up.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to sleep","l":"спать"},null]},{"text":"Вы знаете мальчика, стоя́щего там?","en":"Do you know that boy standing over there?","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"boy","l":"мальчик"},null,null,{"g":"there"}]},{"text":"Лучше умереть стоя, чем жить на коленях.","en":"Better to die on our feet, than to live on our knees.","words":[{"g":"rather, would better )"},{"g":"to die of natural causes"},null,{"g":"than"},{"g":"to live"},{"g":"on / at"},null]},{"text":"Нам аплодировали стоя.","en":"We got a standing ovation.","words":[{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},null,null]},{"text":"Лошади спят стоя.","en":"Horses sleep standing up.","words":[{"g":"horse","l":"лошадь"},{"g":"to sleep","l":"спать"},null]}]}